  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Kosovo Agency of Statistics 2024-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Kosovo Agency of Statistics 2024-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen omfattar flera strategiska initiativ f&#xf6;r att
modernisera kapaciteten f&#xf6;r produktion och spridning av statistik fr&#xe5;n KAS, med
fokus p&#xe5; k&#xf6;nsrelaterad statistik, harmonisering av prisstatistik, anv&#xe4;ndning av registerbaserade
befolkningsdata, standardisering av statistikproduktion som baserar sig p&#xe5; unders&#xf6;kningar och
f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttring av ICT infrastrukturen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention encompasses several strategic initiatives to
modernize KAS&apos;s statistical production and dissemination capabilities, focusing
on gender statistics, price statistics harmonization, the use of register&#xad;based
population data, standardization of survey&#xad;based statistics production, and ICT
infrastructure improvement.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is that Kosovo Agency of  Statistics (KAS) has increased the quality and efficiency of its operational processes and provides users with reliable quality statistics.
Gender statistics
The expected outcome is that KAS has increased the production and dissemination of gender statistics.
Price statistics 
The expected outcome is that the production of price statistics is harmonised.
Register-based statistics 
The expected outcome is that KAS is utilising register-based population data in the statistics production process.
Management of the statistics production process 
The expected outcome is that KAS is implementing standardised processes for survey-based statistics production (GSBPM).
Information and Communication Technology (ICT) 
The expected outcome is that KAS ICT infrastructure and capacities facilitate efficient and secure production and dissemination of statistics.</narrative>
  </description>
